<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Address Submission Notification</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f7f9fc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      color: #333;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      padding: 20px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #2c3e50;
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .highlight {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #1a73e8;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-size: 11px;   /* smaller font */
      color: #999;       /* lighter gray */
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #1a73e8;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <h2>New Address Submission</h2>
    <p>
      User with ID <span class="highlight"><%= userId %></span> has just submitted their address information for verification.  
    </p>
    <p>
      Please review it promptly to ensure timely processing.
    </p>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>
        Need help? Contact our support team at
        <a href="mailto:support@bizvantage.com" class="support-link">
          support@bizvantage.com
        </a>
      </p>
      <p style="margin-top: 8px">©2025 Bizvantage. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>